+"""Packaged bank CSV profiles (profiles.yaml): the column mapping of each named bank's CSV
+export, read by importers/bankcsv.py (R38). A firm whose bank is not here, or whose bank has
+changed its layout, passes its own mapping in the same form with --mapping."""
